    "title": "ALMOST SHOWTIME",
    "text": "Thursday, March 26, 2026\nThe Jamestown Community Band, under the direction of Don Smith, rehearses Tuesday at St. Matthew’s for its free concert scheduled for 7 p.m., Tuesday, March 31, at the recreation center. The performance, “A March Concert,” will feature “a surprising variety of different types of marches that will guarantee toes tapping, hands clapping, some singing and even some whistling,” Smith said. PHOTOS BY ANDREA VON HOHENLEITEN\nPercussionist Bill Knapp bangs his drum.\nOboist Luanna Mackenzie and flautist Stephanie Price perform in the woodwind section.",
